#: ../../src/tty.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_tty_t` --- TTY handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_tty_t` —— TTY 句柄"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:7
msgid "TTY handles represent a stream for the console."
msgstr "TTY 句柄表示用于控制台的流。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:9
msgid ":c:type:`uv_tty_t` is a 'subclass' of :c:type:`uv_stream_t`."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_tty_t` 是 :c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的“子类”。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:13
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:17
msgid "TTY handle type."
msgstr "TTY 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:23
msgid "TTY mode type:"
msgstr "TTY 模式类型："

#: ../../src/tty.rst:43
msgid "Console virtual terminal mode type:"
msgstr "控制台虚拟终端模式类型："

#: ../../src/tty.rst:62
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:64
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:66
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_stream_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:70
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:74
msgid ""
"Initialize a new TTY stream with the given file descriptor. Usually the "
"file descriptor will be:"
msgstr "用给定的文件描述符初始化一个新的 TTY 流。该文件描述符通常是："

#: ../../src/tty.rst:77
msgid "0 = stdin"
msgstr "0 = stdin"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:78
msgid "1 = stdout"
msgstr "1 = stdout"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:79
msgid "2 = stderr"
msgstr "2 = stderr"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:81
msgid ""
"On Unix this function will determine the path of the fd of the terminal "
"using :man:`ttyname_r(3)`, open it, and use it if the passed file "
"descriptor refers to a TTY. This lets libuv put the tty in non-blocking "
"mode without affecting other processes that share the tty."
msgstr "在 Unix 上，此函数会使用 :man:`ttyname_r(3)` 确定该终端 fd 的路径并将其打开；如果传入的文件描述符指向一个 TTY，则使用它。这使得 libuv 能够把 tty 置于非阻塞模式，而不影响共享该 tty 的其他进程。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:86
msgid ""
"This function is not thread safe on systems that don't support ioctl "
"TIOCGPTN or TIOCPTYGNAME, for instance OpenBSD and Solaris."
msgstr "在不支持 ioctl TIOCGPTN 或 TIOCPTYGNAME 的系统（例如 OpenBSD 和 Solaris）上，此函数不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:90
msgid "If reopening the TTY fails, libuv falls back to blocking writes."
msgstr "如果重新打开 TTY 失败，libuv 会回退到阻塞式写入。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:92
msgid ""
"the `readable` parameter is now unused and ignored. The correct value "
"will now be auto-detected from the kernel."
msgstr "`readable` 参数现已不再使用并被忽略。正确的值现在将由内核自动检测。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:95
msgid ""
"the path of the TTY is determined by :man:`ttyname_r(3)`. In earlier "
"versions libuv opened `/dev/tty` instead."
msgstr "TTY 的路径由 :man:`ttyname_r(3)` 确定。在更早的版本中，libuv 打开的是 `/dev/tty`。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:99
msgid ""
"trying to initialize a TTY stream with a file descriptor that refers to a"
" file returns `UV_EINVAL` on UNIX."
msgstr "在 UNIX 上，尝试用指向文件的文件描述符来初始化 TTY 流会返回 `UV_EINVAL`。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:105
msgid "the mode is specified as a :c:enum:`uv_tty_mode_t` value."
msgstr "mode 以 :c:enum:`uv_tty_mode_t` 值的形式指定。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:108
msgid "Set the TTY using the specified terminal mode."
msgstr "使用指定的终端模式设置 TTY。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:112
msgid ""
"To be called when the program exits. Resets TTY settings to default "
"values for the next process to take over."
msgstr "应在程序退出时调用。将 TTY 设置重置为默认值，供下一个进程接管。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:115
msgid ""
"This function is async signal-safe on Unix platforms but can fail with "
"error code ``UV_EBUSY`` if you call it when execution is inside "
":c:func:`uv_tty_set_mode`."
msgstr "此函数在 Unix 平台上是 async signal-safe 的，但如果在执行处于 :c:func:`uv_tty_set_mode` 内部时调用它，则可能失败并返回错误码 ``UV_EBUSY``。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:121
msgid "Gets the current Window size. On success it returns 0."
msgstr "获取当前的窗口大小。成功时返回 0。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:123
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_stream_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:127
msgid ""
"Controls whether console virtual terminal sequences are processed by "
"libuv or console. Useful in particular for enabling ConEmu support of "
"ANSI X3.64 and Xterm 256 colors. Otherwise Windows10 consoles are usually"
" detected automatically."
msgstr "控制控制台虚拟终端序列由 libuv 还是控制台来处理。对于启用 ConEmu 对 ANSI X3.64 和 Xterm 256 色的支持尤其有用。否则，Windows10 控制台通常会被自动检测。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:132
msgid ""
"This function is only meaningful on Windows systems. On Unix it is "
"silently ignored."
msgstr "此函数仅在 Windows 系统上有意义。在 Unix 上它会被静默忽略。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:139
msgid ""
"Get the current state of whether console virtual terminal sequences are "
"handled by libuv or the console."
msgstr "获取控制台虚拟终端序列当前由 libuv 还是控制台处理的状态。"

#: ../../src/tty.rst:142
msgid "This function is not implemented on Unix, where it returns ``UV_ENOTSUP``."
msgstr "此函数在 Unix 上未实现，在该平台上返回 ``UV_ENOTSUP``。"

